[[2047,31,65536,"<h3>Functional description</h3><p>The heated rear windscreen relay \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>R3</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              ,\nlocated in the junction unit\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B1</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              , controls the simultaneous\nactivation of the demisting of both the rear windscreen \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>P55</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               and\nthe external rear view mirrors \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>P60</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               and \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n              