\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B99</strong></p><p>The coil for relay \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>R3</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                                energized\nwhen the ignition is switched on (INT/A) by the line for fuse \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F6</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               \nof the additional fuse box \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B98</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p><p>An earth signal coming from the integrated\nservices control unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M40</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               (pin 9 of connector B) energizes\nthe coil of the relay \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>R1</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              , with the supply consequently sent\nto resistors \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>P55</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              , \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>P60</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               and \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>P61</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              . (the control\ncircuit of the heated rear window \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>P55</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               passes through the\naerial \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>P22</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               control unit. (\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <a href=\"#/3234201\">E3510</a>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              )</p><p>The supply circuit of the heated rear window \n\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>P55 passes through a special interference filter in versions\nwith predisposition for a radio.</strong></p><p>The control unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M40</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               is supplied\nwhen the ignition (INT) is switched on from the line for fuse \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F1</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               of\nthe junction unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B1</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               (pin 7 of connector B).</p><p>When an earth command is received (pin 14\nof connector B) coming from the climate control unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M70</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               (heated\nrear windscreen on button pressed), according to the control logic\ndescribed previously, a command is sent which energizes the coil\no\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>f</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              relay\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>R3</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              (pin 9 of connector B).</p><p>At the same time as the activation of the\nresistors, a signal is sent (from pin 11, of connector B of \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M40</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              )\nto light up the LED in the control button which is located in the\nclimate control unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M70</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p><p>- Version with Heater. When an earth command\nis received (pin 14 of connector B) coming from the heater \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>H80</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               (heated\nrear windscreen on button pressed), according to the control logic\ndescribed previously, a command is sent which energizes the coil\nof the relay \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>R3</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              (pin 9 of connector B). At the same time\nas the activation of the resistors, a signal is sent (from pin 11,\nof connector B of \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M40</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              ) to light up the LED in the control\nbutton which is located in \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>H80</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p>"]]